denny.rich@swagelok.com (Denny Rich) wrote:

>Like the original message but my system is: DEC 3000/M300. Looks like
>72pin PC stuff. What specs? is it really 34 bit?  and I know if have
>to add it in pairs. But what sort of memory ?
>
